WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.704
Today is the second move. Cover and slide.

2
00:00:03.154 --> 00:00:05.733
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:06.233 --> 00:00:12.445
First, cut out the slide card. It is on the page after today's page. Any strip of paper works too.

4
00:00:12.895 --> 00:00:16.458
A guess needs the whole word at once. The card takes that away.

5
00:00:16.908 --> 00:00:21.401
Cover the word with the card. Slide it to the right, until one letter shows.

6
00:00:22.457 --> 00:00:23.288
Slide again.

7
00:00:24.672 --> 00:00:25.348
And again.

8
00:00:26.511 --> 00:00:27.526
The word is cap.

9
00:00:28.326 --> 00:00:34.022
Today's words start the same way. Cat, cap, can. Only the last letter tells them apart.

10
00:00:34.472 --> 00:00:38.165
So a guess from the first letter fails, and your child can see why.

11
00:00:38.615 --> 00:00:42.505
Do the first row together with the card. Your child does the other rows.

12
00:00:42.955 --> 00:00:49.237
For job two, press play on your child's sound track and step away. The voice waits, then says each word.

13
00:00:49.687 --> 00:00:52.199
At the end, your child reads three words to you.
